      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAWBOURNE MASON (5) ran a nice race two back to fill a minor placing then got off the mark last time (23.31) at this track over 400m. Rates to win again. STAN BY ME (2) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a slick early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten 5 lengths at Dubbo over 400m in 23.43. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Overdue and is among the main hopes. IVORY NARA (1) turned in a solid run last start over 320m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 0.8 lengths (18.80). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Warrants plenty of respect. SILENT EDGE (6) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can make amends.",
